[TITLE]
synthetic: lidnode::validate over [LID_NODE_OUTLETS] anchors: weir and outlet crests,
conduit offsets at either end, two-LID and no-LID links, layers outside the stack

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS CFS
FLOW_ROUTING DYNWAVE

[STORAGE]
A 10.3 2.5 0 FUNCTIONAL 0 0 1000 0 0
B 10 2.5 0 FUNCTIONAL 0 0 1000 0 0
P 9 2.5 0 FUNCTIONAL 0 0 1000 0 0

[JUNCTIONS]
J 11.5 5 0 0 0
K 8 5 0 0 0

[OUTFALLS]
FA 0 FREE NO
FB 0 FREE NO

[CONDUITS]
C_top A K 100 0.01 1.0 0 0 0
C_in K A 100 0.01 0 1.0 0 0
C_off A K 100 0.01 1.5 0 0 0
C_two A B 100 0.01 0 0 0 0
C_none J K 100 0.01 0 0 0 0
C_far A K 100 0.01 0 0 0 0
C_bot A K 100 0.01 0 0 0 0

[WEIRS]
W_A A FA TRANSVERSE 2.0 3.3 NO 0 0 NO
W_JB J B TRANSVERSE 0.5 3.3 NO 0 0 NO
W_bad B FB TRANSVERSE 1.2 3.3 NO 0 0 NO

[OUTLETS]
OL_A A FB 1.5 FUNCTIONAL/DEPTH 10 0.5 NO
OL_B B FB 1.0 TABULAR/DEPTH Rating NO

[CURVES]
Rating Rating 0 0
Rating 1 1

[XSECTIONS]
C_top CIRCULAR 1 0 0 0 1
C_in CIRCULAR 1 0 0 0 1
C_off CIRCULAR 1 0 0 0 1
C_two CIRCULAR 1 0 0 0 1
C_none CIRCULAR 1 0 0 0 1
C_far CIRCULAR 1 0 0 0 1
C_bot CIRCULAR 1 0 0 0 1
W_A RECT_OPEN .5 4 0 0
W_JB RECT_OPEN .5 4 0 0
W_bad RECT_OPEN .5 4 0 0

[LID_CONTROLS]
Train NODE
Train SURFACE 6 .1
Train MEDIA 12 .45 .20 .08 5 3 3
Train AGGREGATE 12 .40 100
Train BOTTOM 0 0

[LID_NODES]
A Train 10
B Train 10

[LID_NODE_OUTLETS]
W_A 1 BOTTOM
OL_A 2 BOTTOM
OL_B 3 TOP
C_top 3 TOP
C_in 3 TOP
C_off 3 TOP
C_two 1 TOP
C_none 1 TOP
C_far 4 TOP
C_bot 3 BOTTOM
W_JB 3 BOTTOM
W_bad 1 BOTTOM
